# The coach image is built from the repository root (it needs two files from content/).
# Docker reads this file, not coach/.dockerignore, for that build. Send only what the
# Dockerfile copies: never .env, virtual environments or anything else in the repo.
*
!coach/pyproject.toml
!coach/uv.lock
!coach/app/
!content/crisis_terms.json
!content/shame_terms.json
**/__pycache__
